WEBVTT

01:41.200 --> 01:45.920
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WORK
"LOVER" BY SHE MU SI

02:04.440 --> 02:07.920
Look at this, Lin. What a feast.

02:08.520 --> 02:10.639
Although you don't get to taste it,

02:10.720 --> 02:12.320
your eyes can feast on it.

02:12.400 --> 02:14.760
Today, I'll live stream the meal for you.

02:14.840 --> 02:17.400
And you will watch me eat.

02:17.480 --> 02:20.480
The shredded squid is my favorite.

02:20.560 --> 02:22.440
Why don't you save me some?

02:24.640 --> 02:26.080
How do I save it for you?

02:26.160 --> 02:27.240
When you're discharged,

02:27.320 --> 02:29.440
I'll tell Maidong
to buy a fresh batch for you.

02:29.520 --> 02:30.680
I knew it.

02:30.760 --> 02:33.280
I can never steal your food.

02:33.360 --> 02:35.680
What an old glutton.

02:35.760 --> 02:39.160
Now you know what I'm like.

02:43.400 --> 02:44.280
Here.

02:45.400 --> 02:46.520
It's Ms. Lin.

02:46.600 --> 02:47.560
Ms. Lin!

02:47.640 --> 02:49.040
Happy New Year!

02:49.120 --> 02:51.280
Happy New Year to you too, Maidong.

02:51.360 --> 02:54.240
Maidong. I passed your grandma
the New Year's money.

02:54.320 --> 02:55.640
Don't forget to get it from her.

02:56.120 --> 02:58.640
Otherwise, she might keep it for herself.

02:58.720 --> 03:00.440
Okay, I will.

03:01.120 --> 03:03.200
Well, carry on. I'm heading out.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.920
Sure, go ahead.

03:05.000 --> 03:05.840
Bye!

03:09.040 --> 03:10.080
Lin,

03:10.760 --> 03:12.200
I saw some jokes

03:12.280 --> 03:14.720
written by some old people online.

03:14.800 --> 03:16.400
I was amused

03:16.480 --> 03:17.800
by that nonsense.

03:18.440 --> 03:20.480
You finally found yourself
some good friends

03:20.560 --> 03:21.880
while I'm gone.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.560
Let me read them out for you.

03:25.400 --> 03:26.720
"There was an old lady.

03:27.520 --> 03:31.560
She said that she wanted
to fall in love again,

03:31.640 --> 03:34.440
but she was attracted to older men.

03:34.520 --> 03:35.680
Eventually,

03:35.760 --> 03:37.320
she realized that she couldn't find any."

03:39.280 --> 03:41.520
Also, the doctor who kept telling me

03:41.600 --> 03:43.680
to take care of my health

03:43.760 --> 03:45.200
passed away.

03:45.720 --> 03:48.440
Meanwhile, I'm still alive.

03:48.520 --> 03:51.240
I'm living longer than I should!

03:53.680 --> 03:57.080
Also, this is really funny.

03:59.720 --> 04:02.560
What is this? I can't read my own writing.

04:12.760 --> 04:14.280
Time for dinner!

04:25.560 --> 04:27.920
Dad and Mr. He don't drink alcohol.

04:28.000 --> 04:30.320
He must be feeling lonely
after being alone for so long.

04:30.400 --> 04:31.840
We'll just prepare wine for them.

04:31.920 --> 04:33.120
They don't have to drink it,

04:33.200 --> 04:34.560
but it'll be there if they want it.

04:34.640 --> 04:35.920
Otherwise, it'll be our fault.

04:51.800 --> 04:52.800
Uncle.

04:53.960 --> 04:54.960
Dad.

04:56.560 --> 04:57.720
Don't be shy.

04:58.560 --> 05:00.320
Tell me in my dreams
if you have any requests.

05:02.600 --> 05:05.080
Enough. Quit fooling around. Let's eat.

05:05.160 --> 05:06.240
Quick.

05:07.400 --> 05:09.040
Zhuang Yan, it's time to eat.

05:09.120 --> 05:10.720
-Here.
-Let's eat.

05:10.800 --> 05:11.680
Let's dig in.

05:17.200 --> 05:18.080
Give it a taste.

05:32.640 --> 05:33.960
We agreed to drink together.

05:34.040 --> 05:35.400
Why are you drinking on your own?

05:35.480 --> 05:36.520
Here.

05:36.600 --> 05:37.680
Let me propose a toast

05:37.760 --> 05:39.240
for the festive season.

05:39.320 --> 05:40.360
Here.

05:40.440 --> 05:42.160
-Happy New Year!
-Happy New Year!

05:42.240 --> 05:44.320
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

05:44.400 --> 05:45.240
Cheers!

05:45.320 --> 05:47.400
Our first New Year's Day
without He Zhangyue.

06:12.640 --> 06:14.480
I feel sorry for the clock.

06:14.560 --> 06:16.080
You're staring holes into it.

06:18.080 --> 06:19.440
Do you have plans this evening?

06:21.800 --> 06:22.760
It's nothing important.

06:22.840 --> 06:24.640
I'm meeting friends for a countdown party.

06:26.000 --> 06:27.200
Why?

06:27.280 --> 06:29.840
Will the new year not arrive
if you do the countdown at home?

06:31.680 --> 06:35.120
If you don't mind,
I can invite my friends over too.

06:39.600 --> 06:40.600
It's New Year's Eve.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.200
It's normal to spend it with friends.

06:42.280 --> 06:44.680
Some of my classmates
are organizing an online event.

06:44.760 --> 06:46.880
Yes. My classmates too!

06:46.960 --> 06:48.120
They invited me to the square

06:48.200 --> 06:49.640
for fireworks and the countdown.

06:49.720 --> 06:50.760
Are they all orphans?

06:51.840 --> 06:52.840
Do they not have families?

06:55.800 --> 06:57.520
The New Year should be spent with family.

06:57.600 --> 06:58.960
Why are they out and about?

07:02.320 --> 07:04.760
Our family never had this rule before.

07:05.760 --> 07:07.800
That was when Mr. He was still alive.

07:07.880 --> 07:08.960
Nonsense.

07:11.960 --> 07:14.080
Mom, if you're annoyed at me,
just come at me.

07:14.640 --> 07:16.240
Don't ruin their mood.

07:16.320 --> 07:17.600
When Mr. He was still alive,

07:17.680 --> 07:18.960
he didn't like us quarreling.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.000
Stop talking about him.

07:20.080 --> 07:21.280
You started it.

07:38.760 --> 07:39.960
Enough, He Niaoniao!

07:40.040 --> 07:41.800
Put that blasted thing away.

07:42.560 --> 07:44.960
Normal folk don't use a vacuum
that is worth thousands of yuan!

07:45.040 --> 07:48.200
Mom, can we spend the holiday in harmony?

07:48.280 --> 07:49.520
That's up to you!

07:51.080 --> 07:53.080
It's the first New Year without Mr. He,

07:53.160 --> 07:55.840
but you want to go out,
neglecting your younger siblings.

07:55.920 --> 07:57.840
Do you act like their elder sister?

07:58.800 --> 08:00.360
Do you know what time it is now?

08:00.960 --> 08:02.560
Decent women go out at this hour.

08:02.640 --> 08:04.160
You're not making any sense.

08:04.240 --> 08:06.360
Why do you put down your own daughter?

08:06.440 --> 08:08.400
You lash out without thinking about it.

08:08.480 --> 08:10.720
You can ask them
if they've ever been hurt by your words.

08:11.520 --> 08:12.720
I've been putting up with it.

08:12.800 --> 08:14.000
Are you over it yet?

08:15.760 --> 08:17.640
Get out of here if you're sick of it!

08:20.360 --> 08:22.600
I know all of you look down on me.

08:23.280 --> 08:25.400
You think I am uneducated and crude.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.760
But in case you forgot,

08:26.840 --> 08:29.320
I am the one who brought you up!

08:29.400 --> 08:31.560
Ask yourselves this.

08:31.640 --> 08:32.640
Aren't you all difficult?

08:33.240 --> 08:34.240
Because of your leg,

08:34.320 --> 08:36.960
I have never said anything harsh
to you since you were little.

08:37.039 --> 08:38.600
I bought a 120 m² house for Zhuang Yan.

08:38.679 --> 08:39.600
Yours is 140 m²

08:39.679 --> 08:40.840
so you wouldn't be upset.

08:41.320 --> 08:43.120
I was also worried about your future.

08:43.200 --> 08:45.200
I get it now.

08:45.280 --> 08:47.080
I brought this upon myself.

08:49.880 --> 08:51.880
You can ask any mom out there.

08:51.960 --> 08:54.800
Which one isn't worried
when their daughters go out late at night?

08:55.560 --> 08:57.280
I know you all very well.

08:57.360 --> 08:59.000
The countdown is merely an excuse

08:59.080 --> 09:00.520
to have some alcohol and fun.

09:00.600 --> 09:02.080
Women always end up as the victims.

09:02.160 --> 09:03.000
Mom,

09:04.240 --> 09:05.360
I'm almost 30.

09:05.840 --> 09:08.240
I know if someone
wants to take advantage of me.

09:10.680 --> 09:11.960
Just because of my leg,

09:14.000 --> 09:15.840
it's never easy for me to date.

09:20.680 --> 09:23.000
Even if I want to seek pleasure,

09:24.720 --> 09:26.720
who am I bothering?

09:30.680 --> 09:32.200
If we have to talk about this,

09:33.600 --> 09:35.280
I should be grateful

09:36.480 --> 09:38.320
if anyone wants to take advantage of me.

10:05.880 --> 10:06.720
Jie.

10:10.240 --> 10:11.760
Jie.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.240
Jie.

10:14.800 --> 10:15.760
Don't be mad at Mom.

10:15.840 --> 10:17.000
You're not entirely the reason

10:17.080 --> 10:18.680
why she is in a bad mood.

10:19.600 --> 10:21.480
Something happened
at the factory a few days ago.

10:21.560 --> 10:23.440
A new guy almost got his hand trapped

10:23.520 --> 10:24.440
in the machine.

10:24.520 --> 10:26.800
They have paused operations
for training until next week.

10:28.280 --> 10:29.680
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

10:30.240 --> 10:31.360
Mom told me not to.

10:31.920 --> 10:35.280
Actually, I think it's not merely
about the workplace accident.

10:35.360 --> 10:37.280
Mom must be missing Mr. He again.

10:38.760 --> 10:39.640
Jie,

10:40.560 --> 10:41.880
this time,

10:43.280 --> 10:44.880
I can tell that Mom is getting older.

10:46.080 --> 10:48.440
The other day, I saw her
basking in the sun in the yard,

10:48.520 --> 10:50.200
and she quickly dozed off.

10:51.160 --> 10:52.720
She's becoming a bit like our grandma.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.320
When Mr. He was still around,

10:56.920 --> 10:58.400
I never let her win any arguments.

10:59.320 --> 11:01.920
Sometimes,
I deliberately found fault with her.

11:02.000 --> 11:04.560
I thought she was domineering and a bully.

11:04.640 --> 11:06.120
But I've been thinking about this.

11:07.000 --> 11:08.320
Take my artwork for example.

11:09.960 --> 11:12.360
Mom has no idea
what those artworks are about.

11:13.240 --> 11:15.280
So how could she possibly
fully support my decision?

11:16.040 --> 11:18.440
Her education level and her experiences

11:19.440 --> 11:22.120
can't help her understand
my dream to be an artist.

11:23.160 --> 11:24.360
Our mom

11:25.800 --> 11:27.440
will never be like us.

11:29.520 --> 11:30.880
I get what you're trying to say.

11:31.520 --> 11:34.000
I was just throwing a fit.

11:34.520 --> 11:35.920
Go back

11:36.560 --> 11:37.920
and comfort her.

11:38.000 --> 11:40.720
Jie. Don't worry.

11:41.360 --> 11:42.600
One day, she will understand

11:43.400 --> 11:44.960
your relationship with Maidong.

11:46.440 --> 11:48.240
I don't even understand our relationship,

11:49.320 --> 11:50.640
let alone her.

11:52.640 --> 11:53.520
Jie,

11:54.200 --> 11:55.160
being misunderstood

11:56.040 --> 11:57.680
is a part of life.

11:58.880 --> 12:00.040
You will get hurt

12:00.720 --> 12:02.120
if you seek others' approval.

12:05.160 --> 12:07.760
I know. I'm fine.

12:07.840 --> 12:09.280
You're all grown up.

12:23.240 --> 12:24.800
BOTTOMLESS DRINKS

12:24.880 --> 12:27.600
SPARKLING NEW YEAR'S EVE NEON PARTY

13:02.080 --> 13:02.960
Let's drink.

13:03.560 --> 13:04.680
I don't drink.

13:04.760 --> 13:06.320
Try something else. This one.

13:06.400 --> 13:07.800
Come on.

13:16.600 --> 13:19.320
SPARKLING NEW YEAR'S EVE

13:20.600 --> 13:22.280
Fifteen. Twenty. No!

13:22.360 --> 13:23.760
-Fifteen. Twenty.
-Fifteen!

13:29.680 --> 13:31.480
You make me cringe. I can't stand this.

13:31.560 --> 13:32.480
I mean it.

13:32.560 --> 13:33.560
Happy New Year!

13:33.640 --> 13:35.240
-Happy New Year!
-Happy New Year!

13:38.680 --> 13:40.720
Slow down. No one will take it from you.

13:40.800 --> 13:41.880
I got it for you.

13:43.760 --> 13:44.600
Let's go.

13:55.280 --> 13:56.320
Are you wearing perfume?

13:56.400 --> 13:58.040
Yes. It's the New Year.

13:58.120 --> 13:59.560
I'll leave you with a good impression

13:59.640 --> 14:01.680
so that you'll never forget me.

14:01.760 --> 14:04.360
Watch your words. Don't ruin the mood.

14:06.680 --> 14:07.520
You're right!

14:07.600 --> 14:10.160
Holidays are an excuse

14:10.240 --> 14:11.720
for us to celebrate.

14:13.080 --> 14:15.640
You're right. Live in the moment, right?

14:16.760 --> 14:19.720
Chen Maidong, you're not
someone like that, right?

14:20.720 --> 14:21.640
Like what?

14:21.720 --> 14:23.040
Someone who lives in the moment.

14:25.040 --> 14:26.160
I can when I'm with you.

14:29.400 --> 14:30.640
You're just like my mom.

14:31.320 --> 14:32.920
Deep down,

14:33.000 --> 14:34.320
you think I'm an easy woman.

14:35.400 --> 14:37.360
Did you come looking for a fight?

14:38.640 --> 14:39.480
Too bad!

14:39.560 --> 14:41.120
You've chosen me,

14:41.200 --> 14:43.680
so let's be a disgustingly sweet couple!

14:44.200 --> 14:45.640
Watch your words.

14:48.960 --> 14:50.440
What? Do you want lip balm?

14:50.520 --> 14:51.640
I didn't bring any today.

14:52.280 --> 14:53.160
Kiss me.

14:53.760 --> 14:55.400
Quit fooling around. We're in public.

14:56.440 --> 14:58.200
Who cares?
We're a disgustingly sweet couple.

14:58.280 --> 15:00.120
Did you forget again
that I'm a public figure?

15:00.760 --> 15:01.760
Stop fooling around.

15:06.320 --> 15:07.480
What's the matter?

15:07.560 --> 15:08.400
Wait.

15:08.880 --> 15:09.760
Was it you?

15:09.840 --> 15:11.000
Did you do it on purpose?

15:12.160 --> 15:13.000
Do you want to fight?

15:13.080 --> 15:14.000
What's the matter?

15:14.080 --> 15:14.920
He touched me.

15:19.680 --> 15:20.600
Apologize to her.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.760
I overheard your conversation,

15:22.840 --> 15:25.520
so I tried to get closer
and accidentally bumped into you.

15:26.280 --> 15:27.600
Don't take it personally.

15:27.680 --> 15:29.480
It's a countdown party. Let's have fun.

15:29.560 --> 15:31.760
I told you to apologize to her.

15:35.240 --> 15:36.160
No way.

15:38.240 --> 15:39.920
-Hey, guys!
-What are you doing?

15:40.000 --> 15:41.800
-Let's talk it out.
-What do you want?

15:41.880 --> 15:42.800
Speak nicely.

15:44.120 --> 15:44.960
Don't get violent.

15:45.040 --> 15:46.840
Get out of my way!
It's none of your business.

15:46.920 --> 15:48.640
What are you doing?

15:53.440 --> 15:55.960
I don't get it. Why did you stop me?

15:56.040 --> 15:57.520
They got kicked out of the venue.

15:57.600 --> 15:59.160
They deserved it.

16:00.080 --> 16:01.040
You were so impulsive.

16:01.120 --> 16:03.200
I almost thought
that you were there to fight.

16:03.280 --> 16:04.400
What do you mean?

16:04.480 --> 16:07.280
Should I have allowed him
to take advantage of me?

16:07.360 --> 16:08.360
I'm with you.

16:08.440 --> 16:10.800
If a fight happens, you should
stay away and call the police.

16:10.880 --> 16:12.480
But instead, you joined the fight.

16:12.560 --> 16:14.600
Don't bite off more than you can chew.

16:14.680 --> 16:16.120
You are the lousy one.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.240
Me?

16:17.320 --> 16:19.080
Are you saying I'm terrible at fighting?

16:19.160 --> 16:20.520
I know what you're thinking.

16:21.280 --> 16:22.840
You think I ruined the evening.

16:22.920 --> 16:23.880
You're upset, right?

16:23.960 --> 16:26.000
No one wants
to encounter someone like him.

16:26.080 --> 16:28.560
That's why I said
we shouldn't let them go.

16:28.640 --> 16:30.360
Why are you acting so strange today?

16:30.440 --> 16:31.280
What happened?

16:33.240 --> 16:35.560
Do you think
we're incompatible with each other?

16:35.640 --> 16:37.400
Why is it that none of our dates go well?

16:37.480 --> 16:38.800
Forget it. Let's go home.

16:47.160 --> 16:49.360
Don't waste your time
being angry at those losers.

16:50.200 --> 16:52.400
Before you go home,
let's do the countdown first.

16:53.400 --> 16:54.600
Where should we do it?

16:56.840 --> 16:58.800
My grandma is on a video call.

16:58.880 --> 17:00.080
We can't go to my place.

17:03.280 --> 17:04.520
My place, then.

17:04.599 --> 17:05.800
Fight it out with my mom.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.599
Does your mom hate me that much?

17:08.680 --> 17:10.319
Do you think you're that likable?

17:12.319 --> 17:15.000
Or we can sit outside the cinema again.

17:15.880 --> 17:17.200
You deserve something better.

17:18.920 --> 17:21.240
Let's go. We'll go to my new house.

17:22.040 --> 17:23.319
New house?

17:23.400 --> 17:24.319
Did you forget?

17:24.400 --> 17:26.119
My grandma bragged about it to you.

17:26.200 --> 17:27.160
I bought a new place.

17:27.240 --> 17:28.880
Renovations were just finished. Let's go.

17:30.840 --> 17:32.400
Do I look like the kind of woman

17:32.480 --> 17:33.920
who goes home with any guy?

17:34.520 --> 17:35.400
Yes.

17:38.560 --> 17:39.680
Zhuang Jie.

17:39.760 --> 17:41.160
That was just a joke. You're not.

17:41.880 --> 17:44.000
Zhuang Jie, you're not. Look at you.

17:47.080 --> 17:48.080
Taxi!

17:49.880 --> 17:51.440
Let's go.

18:20.280 --> 18:22.560
You shouldn't show me your passcode.

18:22.640 --> 18:23.960
I have memorized it.

18:24.040 --> 18:25.440
I want you to remember it.

18:27.520 --> 18:29.160
No need to take off your shoes.
Come on in.

18:36.160 --> 18:37.280
Chen Maidong,

18:38.200 --> 18:40.040
you have pretty good taste.

18:40.120 --> 18:42.440
Perhaps the people who live in this town

18:42.520 --> 18:43.800
have better taste than you think.

18:45.320 --> 18:46.920
No one has lived here before, right?

18:47.000 --> 18:48.240
My grandma stayed here once.

18:48.320 --> 18:50.240
She hates the elevator,
so she refuses to come.

18:51.280 --> 18:52.640
She is just being thoughtful.

18:53.320 --> 18:55.400
Obviously, you'll stay here
with your future wife.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.680
No one else wants to be here.

18:57.280 --> 18:58.400
How would you know?

18:58.480 --> 19:00.320
Isn't that the normal procedure
for townsfolk?

19:00.400 --> 19:02.760
Matchmaking, blind date,
wedding, and have children.

19:02.840 --> 19:03.880
You're no exception.

19:05.160 --> 19:07.320
Don't bring up matchmaking ever again.

19:07.400 --> 19:09.040
I'm traumatized.

19:09.120 --> 19:10.520
Look at you!

19:29.840 --> 19:30.720
Chen Maidong.

19:32.560 --> 19:33.640
What is this?

19:35.200 --> 19:36.120
What?

19:39.400 --> 19:40.720
What is this?

19:55.680 --> 19:57.000
Put it back.

19:57.080 --> 19:58.880
Rude. How could you
look through my things?

19:58.960 --> 20:00.320
Why not?

20:00.400 --> 20:01.880
This is me.

20:03.560 --> 20:05.120
Give it back.

20:05.200 --> 20:06.760
I'm asking you. Is it me?

20:06.840 --> 20:08.240
Tell me. Is it?

20:08.320 --> 20:09.440
Is it me?

20:10.600 --> 20:11.480
Yes, it is.

20:11.560 --> 20:12.720
So what?

20:16.440 --> 20:19.360
When did you make this?

20:21.640 --> 20:22.680
I can't remember.

20:27.320 --> 20:28.720
In high school.

20:28.800 --> 20:29.640
Really?

20:30.920 --> 20:32.440
Why are you so surprised?

20:33.320 --> 20:35.280
I've always been
more sentimental than you.

20:52.760 --> 20:53.840
Tell me

20:55.840 --> 20:56.960
what happened today.

20:58.240 --> 20:59.440
Is it because of me?

21:02.960 --> 21:05.280
You have to tell me if something happened.

21:07.240 --> 21:08.840
You won't be able to help.

21:09.360 --> 21:11.120
You already have enough on your plate.

21:11.680 --> 21:12.880
I can cope.

21:23.920 --> 21:24.840
Chen Maidong.

21:25.640 --> 21:28.960
Have you ever
brought anyone else here before?

21:30.400 --> 21:31.560
Are you picking another fight?

21:31.640 --> 21:33.240
-Have you?
-No.

21:34.280 --> 21:35.520
What's wrong with you tonight?

21:46.280 --> 21:47.520
So I'm the only one.

21:57.520 --> 21:58.720
Because of your leg,

21:58.800 --> 22:01.320
I have never said anything harsh
to you since you were little.

22:10.720 --> 22:12.720
No reaction?

22:12.800 --> 22:14.440
I'm curious about what you're going to do.

22:16.240 --> 22:17.240
Nonsense.

22:17.840 --> 22:20.000
We're both adults. What do you think?

22:20.080 --> 22:21.120
Zhuang Jie.

22:22.320 --> 22:23.640
Are you drunk?

22:24.640 --> 22:26.280
Your physical condition.

22:26.360 --> 22:27.480
You're both burdens.

22:27.560 --> 22:28.400
No.

22:29.120 --> 22:30.440
I'm just a frivolous person.

22:33.280 --> 22:35.400
I didn't know you well then,

22:36.680 --> 22:38.000
and I have apologized for it.

22:56.160 --> 22:57.360
If you choose Chen Maidong,

22:58.040 --> 22:59.720
this will be your life in the future.

23:39.520 --> 23:41.200
Lin, isn't it pretty?

23:41.280 --> 23:43.200
You can't see it there.

23:43.280 --> 23:46.480
This year, our town
organized a countdown party.

23:46.560 --> 23:48.520
If you could tolerate the crowd,

23:48.600 --> 23:50.160
I would've brought you there.

23:50.800 --> 23:51.680
Give it a minute.

23:51.760 --> 23:53.440
They'll definitely release more fireworks.

23:57.120 --> 23:58.200
Isn't it pretty?

24:06.520 --> 24:07.520
Zhuang Jie,

24:08.520 --> 24:09.960
let me take off your prosthesis.

24:14.040 --> 24:15.760
Just because of my leg,

24:16.560 --> 24:18.800
it's never easy for me to date.

24:21.720 --> 24:23.960
Even if I want to seek pleasure,

24:25.880 --> 24:27.680
who am I bothering?

24:37.800 --> 24:38.840
What's the matter?

24:44.080 --> 24:44.920
What's wrong?

24:47.440 --> 24:48.480
What's wrong?

24:49.560 --> 24:51.040
Zhuang Jie, what's the matter?

24:53.200 --> 24:56.080
Why did you force me?

25:00.120 --> 25:01.240
What did you say?

25:04.840 --> 25:06.760
Repeat what you just said.

25:09.400 --> 25:10.480
I'm regretting this.

25:12.080 --> 25:13.320
I don't want to do it anymore.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.240
Get on.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.240
I'll send you home.

26:04.440 --> 26:06.400
Enough.

26:06.960 --> 26:08.280
I want to sleep.

26:08.360 --> 26:10.320
I won't stay up with you anymore.

26:10.400 --> 26:13.240
We have to stay up until 12 a.m. Please.

26:13.320 --> 26:15.280
Let's do what those young people do.

26:15.360 --> 26:16.720
We should follow the trend.

26:17.320 --> 26:19.160
Let's finish the countdown.

26:19.240 --> 26:21.480
Face the reality.

26:22.200 --> 26:24.800
Do you still think of me
as a healthy person?

26:24.880 --> 26:27.320
Many say that it's difficult
to live through the year,

26:28.120 --> 26:33.040
but we have survived
many years together, right?

26:33.120 --> 26:36.440
I'm terminally ill now.

26:36.920 --> 26:39.120
Aren't you silly?

26:39.200 --> 26:41.360
You're not ill.

26:41.920 --> 26:43.640
You can read fortunes.

26:43.720 --> 26:45.840
You'll definitely be able
to live through the year.

26:46.680 --> 26:48.960
Let us just hang in there.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.720
Come on.

26:51.800 --> 26:55.400
No one else believes in fortune-telling

26:55.480 --> 26:57.680
after they reach their seventies.

26:58.240 --> 27:01.600
I only did that to cheer you up.

27:02.120 --> 27:05.200
You have a grandson,
so you have to do it every day.

27:05.280 --> 27:08.560
In fact, you're not trying
to read his future,

27:08.640 --> 27:11.080
but your own.

27:13.160 --> 27:14.480
Countdowns

27:15.560 --> 27:19.280
aren't just for New Year's Eve.

27:20.240 --> 27:23.320
The countdown started
the moment we were born.

27:24.480 --> 27:26.400
Our age is catching up to us.

27:26.480 --> 27:29.640
We're getting closer to our end.

27:30.520 --> 27:31.840
We have to accept the fact.

27:32.840 --> 27:35.640
Whether we have a big family

27:35.720 --> 27:37.680
or are on our own,

27:38.200 --> 27:39.680
in the end,

27:39.760 --> 27:42.000
we're all alone.

27:42.800 --> 27:43.920
Isn't that true?

28:08.720 --> 28:10.600
I've been thinking about it,
but to no avail.

28:13.520 --> 28:14.880
Is it our difference in genders

28:14.960 --> 28:16.560
or simply because we are different?

28:19.160 --> 28:20.280
If I have offended you,

28:21.280 --> 28:22.680
I apologize.

28:25.280 --> 28:26.680
But you were right.

28:28.680 --> 28:30.440
I can't live in the moment.

28:32.840 --> 28:34.640
Perhaps, you have
overestimated yourself too.

28:38.520 --> 28:39.440
Anyway,

28:41.520 --> 28:42.600
this is quite ridiculous.

28:46.120 --> 28:48.560
As the ancients said,
"A fleeting romance should be avoided."

28:50.440 --> 28:51.680
Indeed.

28:53.320 --> 28:54.440
It's more fragile than paper.

29:00.040 --> 29:00.960
Zhuang Jie,

29:03.080 --> 29:04.240
I'm new to this.

29:04.960 --> 29:06.120
I'm no match for you.

29:09.040 --> 29:10.240
So…

29:13.440 --> 29:14.680
Let's forget about it.

29:21.960 --> 29:23.640
-Ten, nine,
-Ten, nine,

29:23.720 --> 29:26.000
-eight, seven,
-eight, seven,

29:26.080 --> 29:28.440
-six, five,
-six, five,

29:28.960 --> 29:32.240
-four, three, two,
-four, three, two,

29:32.760 --> 29:33.680
-one!
-one!

30:36.280 --> 30:41.800
TO JIE

30:50.280 --> 30:53.840
PEACE AND JOY

30:56.400 --> 30:57.880
I'll sleep with you tonight.

30:59.360 --> 31:02.160
But can you do me a favor?

31:03.360 --> 31:05.480
Stop arguing with Mom, all right?

31:07.160 --> 31:08.440
I don't want you to cry.

31:09.680 --> 31:10.960
I don't want Mom to cry either.

31:13.320 --> 31:14.720
When you both cry,

31:14.800 --> 31:16.560
I feel incredibly sad,

31:17.560 --> 31:19.000
as if I'm being cut by a knife.

31:22.320 --> 31:24.200
I had the same feeling when Dad left.

31:27.440 --> 31:28.800
In fact, I know everything,

31:30.360 --> 31:31.720
but I pretend that I don't.

31:34.480 --> 31:36.840
My classmates and my teacher
take pity on me,

31:39.400 --> 31:40.880
but I don't want them to pity me.

31:42.320 --> 31:44.280
I want to appear cheerful

31:46.760 --> 31:48.920
just like how I was
when Dad was still alive.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.000
Previously,

31:55.080 --> 31:56.960
my teacher made us read a novel

31:58.200 --> 31:59.920
titled My Memories of Old Beijing.

32:01.320 --> 32:02.520
When I read the chapter

32:04.120 --> 32:07.840
"Papa's Flowers Have Fallen,
and I Was No Longer a Child",

32:10.120 --> 32:11.400
I was close to tears,

32:13.320 --> 32:14.640
but I managed to hold them back.

32:17.480 --> 32:19.040
I think my childhood ended

32:19.640 --> 32:22.440
along with Ying-tzu's childhood.

32:25.600 --> 32:27.680
Then I thought about my mom,

32:27.760 --> 32:29.160
my sister, and my brother.

32:29.960 --> 32:31.760
And that cheered me up a little.

32:33.840 --> 32:34.680
Jie,

32:35.600 --> 32:37.560
I hope that neither you nor Mom will cry.

32:40.120 --> 32:41.680
We still have each other.

33:23.680 --> 33:25.040
Is the store open today?

33:26.920 --> 33:28.880
It's New Year's Day.
I'll take the day off.

33:29.600 --> 33:31.880
I'll go to Chengdu
to buy the marinade for you tomorrow.

33:33.480 --> 33:35.920
Good idea. There's a training tomorrow.

33:36.000 --> 33:36.920
Salt.

33:37.640 --> 33:38.880
I have to keep an eye on them.

33:40.080 --> 33:41.160
I know someone in Wushan.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.320
He's a food supplier.

33:42.800 --> 33:44.320
He has been asking me to visit him.

33:44.400 --> 33:47.280
I'll pay him a visit
and see if we can buy anything from him.

33:47.360 --> 33:49.400
Niaoniao and Zhuang Yan can help sell

33:49.480 --> 33:50.880
and earn some pocket money.

33:52.160 --> 33:54.240
They can learn a thing or two.

33:55.280 --> 33:57.840
No need to rush home. Enjoy the trip.

34:00.320 --> 34:02.520
Wake up for breakfast!

34:02.600 --> 34:03.600
Look at you all,

34:03.680 --> 34:05.560
lazing around
on the first day of the year.

34:06.600 --> 34:07.960
Breakfast is ready!

34:08.040 --> 34:09.719
JINLI

34:09.800 --> 34:13.719
CHENGDU

34:13.800 --> 34:17.320
GUARANTEED QUALITY

34:23.040 --> 34:24.679
Mr. Zhang.

34:24.760 --> 34:26.920
Can you send out these goods
first thing tomorrow?

34:27.000 --> 34:27.840
My mom needs them.

34:27.920 --> 34:30.159
In the future,
please keep up with the quality.

34:30.239 --> 34:31.239
Don't make any mistakes.

34:31.320 --> 34:33.800
Don't worry. We'll do our best
for an important client like you.

34:33.880 --> 34:34.920
Don't worry.

34:35.400 --> 34:36.760
All right.

34:42.120 --> 34:43.400
Hello?

34:43.480 --> 34:45.040
Zhuang Jie, are you home yet?

34:45.120 --> 34:46.960
Why do you keep asking me
the same question?

34:47.040 --> 34:48.360
You've had this cold for days.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.760
Why are you still in Chengdu?

34:49.840 --> 34:52.400
Stop nagging me. I'll go home tonight.

34:52.480 --> 34:54.840
I've realized
that you've been faking it all along.

34:54.920 --> 34:56.920
You don't take care of yourself
when you're sick.

34:57.000 --> 34:58.160
Zhuang Jie, I'm warning you.

34:58.240 --> 34:59.960
If you're not at home
the next time I call,

35:00.040 --> 35:01.000
I'll end our friendship.

35:01.080 --> 35:02.840
Do you hear me? Bye now.

35:09.600 --> 35:10.560
What are you doing?

35:10.640 --> 35:12.480
Do you think this is a basketball hoop?

35:12.560 --> 35:13.760
I didn't hit you.

35:13.840 --> 35:16.080
No kidding.
You would be in trouble if you did.

35:17.200 --> 35:18.080
Stop right there.

35:19.160 --> 35:20.360
Did you sort the garbage?

35:21.120 --> 35:23.800
Are you the old lady
on the neighborhood committee?

35:23.880 --> 35:24.960
I'm a citizen.

35:25.040 --> 35:25.960
It's a citizen's duty

35:26.040 --> 35:27.720
to sort their garbage.

35:27.800 --> 35:29.120
-Madwoman.
-Wait.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.320
Did you call me a madwoman?

35:30.400 --> 35:31.600
Stop right there.

35:31.680 --> 35:33.640
Sort the trash
or I'll report it to the committee.

35:33.720 --> 35:34.800
Stop filming me.

35:34.880 --> 35:36.080
Do you hear me?

35:36.160 --> 35:37.160
What are you doing?

35:37.240 --> 35:38.160
Delete it now!

35:38.240 --> 35:39.520
-Delete it.
-What are you doing?

35:39.600 --> 35:40.480
What are you doing?

35:41.560 --> 35:42.480
And who are you?

35:44.440 --> 35:46.400
Pretend I'm on the neighborhood committee.

35:47.080 --> 35:48.000
Buddy,

35:48.720 --> 35:49.800
listen to my advice.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.960
If you're in the wrong, don't argue.

35:52.040 --> 35:52.880
It's embarrassing.

35:52.960 --> 35:54.000
You…

35:58.360 --> 35:59.920
Why are there so many mad people today?

36:00.000 --> 36:00.960
What did you say?

36:11.920 --> 36:13.040
Thank you.

36:24.480 --> 36:25.720
That guy.

36:25.800 --> 36:27.360
I apologize on his behalf.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.280
Don't stay mad.

36:29.360 --> 36:30.880
How can you apologize on his behalf?

36:30.960 --> 36:32.000
Do you represent all men?

36:32.880 --> 36:34.160
You're mocking me again.

36:34.240 --> 36:36.440
I don't want you
to suffer from Qi stagnation.

36:36.520 --> 36:37.840
You're exaggerating.

36:37.920 --> 36:39.040
Forget it.

36:39.120 --> 36:40.040
What brings you here?

36:40.920 --> 36:42.960
You ordered another 50 medicinal patches.

36:43.040 --> 36:44.240
I'm delivering it to you.

36:44.320 --> 36:46.200
I was going to leave them
at your doorstep,

36:46.280 --> 36:47.640
but I ran into you here.

36:49.000 --> 36:50.800
Are you delivering it yourself again?

36:51.640 --> 36:52.760
Didn't I say it before?

36:52.840 --> 36:55.040
I want to see to your matters myself.

36:58.160 --> 36:59.360
Then…

36:59.440 --> 37:00.320
I'll pay you.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.640
Don't worry about the money.

37:01.720 --> 37:03.040
I brought you a gift.

37:04.800 --> 37:07.040
Didn't you say
that you don't like vegetables?

37:10.080 --> 37:11.640
You'll definitely like this.

37:13.040 --> 37:14.760
It's rich in collagen

37:14.840 --> 37:15.800
and tastes good.

37:16.480 --> 37:17.480
I'll put it here for you.

37:17.560 --> 37:19.200
There are four of them. Enjoy the food.

37:19.280 --> 37:20.640
It'll be more than enough.

37:21.240 --> 37:22.120
Here.

37:27.200 --> 37:28.120
Wait.

37:28.680 --> 37:30.200
I can't read your expression again.

37:31.720 --> 37:33.280
It's nothing. I'll take this.

37:33.360 --> 37:34.280
Thank you.

37:35.720 --> 37:37.000
Is it not the right gift again?

37:43.520 --> 37:45.040
To express my gratitude,

37:45.120 --> 37:46.720
why don't you come in for a cup of tea?

38:26.400 --> 38:27.320
Thank you.

38:38.000 --> 38:39.680
Why are you being so shy?

38:39.760 --> 38:42.440
Are you attracted
to my unkempt appearance?

38:43.240 --> 38:46.640
It's not your appearance that attracts me.

38:46.720 --> 38:48.800
You sound like a hypocrite, Dr. Cui.

38:48.880 --> 38:50.520
Do you not care about one's appearance?

38:51.720 --> 38:54.480
I'm used to looking past appearances.

38:55.440 --> 38:56.280
Look.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.640
These supplements show

38:58.720 --> 39:01.040
that you strive for beauty

39:01.120 --> 39:02.480
and a fair complexion.

39:02.560 --> 39:03.480
I understand.

39:03.560 --> 39:06.040
Fair skin makes an ugly woman pretty.

39:10.240 --> 39:11.400
Watch your words.

39:11.480 --> 39:12.800
I don't want to end it again.

39:12.880 --> 39:15.800
What I'm trying to say is
that your complexion

39:15.880 --> 39:17.720
is determined by your Qi and blood.

39:17.800 --> 39:19.240
If you want a good complexion,

39:19.320 --> 39:21.600
you need to take it slowly and be patient.

39:22.280 --> 39:25.360
You are a very disciplined woman.

39:25.440 --> 39:27.920
You persevere and never give up.

39:28.000 --> 39:30.080
Those are the things
that make you beautiful.

39:30.160 --> 39:31.960
You're a pretty good doctor.

39:32.520 --> 39:33.680
Thanks for your advice.

39:33.760 --> 39:35.280
You shouldn't doubt my professionalism

39:35.360 --> 39:37.240
because you've seen me
make a fool of myself.

39:37.320 --> 39:38.280
You're right.

39:40.080 --> 39:41.600
Sorry, I have to take this.

39:43.000 --> 39:44.320
Where are you now, dear?

39:48.040 --> 39:49.240
I listened to you,

39:49.320 --> 39:50.560
and I'm on a train heading home.

39:52.000 --> 39:53.640
You're sick and need a good rest.

39:53.720 --> 39:55.160
Stop wandering around.

39:56.680 --> 39:57.800
What bothers me now

39:58.520 --> 39:59.760
isn't my physical health

40:00.400 --> 40:01.400
but my emotions.

40:02.600 --> 40:04.920
I knew something was wrong.

40:05.000 --> 40:06.880
What's the matter?
Is it about Chen Maidong?

40:07.480 --> 40:09.080
All in all, this is really annoying.

40:10.000 --> 40:12.680
Now I know why Plato
advocated a platonic relationship

40:12.760 --> 40:14.600
free from any sexual desires.

40:16.560 --> 40:18.040
Just cut to the chase.

40:24.520 --> 40:26.640
On New Year's Eve,

40:26.720 --> 40:28.400
I went on a date with Chen Maidong.

40:40.960 --> 40:42.880
You brought this upon yourself,
Zhuang Jie.

40:44.760 --> 40:45.600
Hey.

40:47.000 --> 40:48.160
Wang Xixia,

40:48.240 --> 40:49.800
are you really my friend?

40:49.880 --> 40:52.080
Why are you scolding me
when I've told you the truth?

40:52.160 --> 40:53.200
Am I scolding you?

40:53.280 --> 40:54.480
This is nothing.

40:54.560 --> 40:56.960
If I were Chen Maidong,
I would have beaten you up.

40:57.040 --> 40:59.520
Of course, a man should never hit women.

40:59.600 --> 41:01.720
Chen Maidong is a decent guy.

41:01.800 --> 41:04.160
I mean, how could you do that, Zhuang Jie?

41:04.240 --> 41:05.280
Clearly, it was consensual

41:05.360 --> 41:07.040
between mature adults,

41:07.120 --> 41:08.640
but you ended up blaming him.

41:08.720 --> 41:10.120
-I--
-Stop explaining. Let me finish.

41:10.200 --> 41:11.160
This is too much.

41:11.240 --> 41:12.640
Whatever you did

41:12.720 --> 41:14.680
violates the principle of gender equality.

41:14.760 --> 41:16.440
Moreover, it sounds to me

41:16.520 --> 41:18.960
that you were the one who seduced him.

41:19.040 --> 41:20.120
When he got into the mood,

41:20.200 --> 41:22.720
you said that he forced you into it.

41:22.800 --> 41:24.000
Do you know how terrible

41:24.080 --> 41:25.520
those words sounded to Chen Maidong?

41:25.600 --> 41:26.960
Have you considered that?

41:27.840 --> 41:30.800
I wasn't thinking straight at that time,

41:31.640 --> 41:33.800
so I just said whatever came to mind.

41:34.920 --> 41:36.280
Before that, I teased him and said

41:36.360 --> 41:38.440
that he fought a lot back in school.

41:38.520 --> 41:40.240
Apparently, he took it to heart.

41:40.320 --> 41:42.120
Of course he did.

41:42.200 --> 41:44.200
A rumor in town says
that he used to be a gangster

41:44.280 --> 41:45.120
when he was a kid.

41:45.200 --> 41:46.960
He can ignore what others say,

41:47.040 --> 41:48.400
but he trusted you a lot.

41:48.480 --> 41:50.000
Hearing it from you

41:50.080 --> 41:52.640
must have deeply affected and upset him.

41:52.720 --> 41:54.920
It's another matter
if you can spend your future together.

41:55.000 --> 41:56.200
But now, as a decent person,

41:56.280 --> 41:57.360
you must apologize to him.

41:57.440 --> 41:58.480
Do you hear me?

41:59.080 --> 42:01.440
Besides, from now on,
stop talking about Plato.

42:01.520 --> 42:03.320
A sexual relationship is not inferior

42:03.400 --> 42:04.560
to a spiritual relationship.

42:04.640 --> 42:06.920
Besides, we are all humans, not saints.

42:07.000 --> 42:08.280
Understood.

42:08.360 --> 42:10.120
Why are you being so mean?

42:10.200 --> 42:12.720
Is this a speech? Do you have an audience?

42:12.800 --> 42:14.720
I called you to confide in you.

42:14.800 --> 42:15.840
You've made me more upset.

42:15.920 --> 42:18.240
Enough. Hurry up and apologize to him.

42:18.320 --> 42:19.680
I'm disappointed in you.

42:19.760 --> 42:22.320
When you're in Shanghai,
you act like a feminist.

42:22.400 --> 42:24.160
You reveal your true self
when you're at home.

42:24.240 --> 42:25.640
-Hello?
-Hello?

42:25.720 --> 42:26.560
Hello?

42:28.240 --> 42:29.960
How dare you hang up on me?

42:30.040 --> 42:30.960
Dang it.

42:32.000 --> 42:33.200
She always makes me worry.

42:37.080 --> 42:38.840
What? Have you never seen women bickering?

42:40.320 --> 42:43.720
You're scolding her.

42:44.600 --> 42:45.440
Are you scared now?

42:45.520 --> 42:46.720
It's not too late to leave.

42:47.680 --> 42:48.760
It's too late.

42:49.600 --> 42:50.880
I've fallen deeper for you.

42:52.720 --> 42:53.720
You…

42:53.800 --> 42:56.120
You just can't stop
expressing your affection, can you?

42:56.200 --> 42:57.600
I failed to hold it back.

43:01.200 --> 43:02.960
What are you doing here?

43:03.040 --> 43:05.080
Hold on. Did you fill them in correctly?

43:05.160 --> 43:06.480
I've placed it…

43:08.880 --> 43:10.880
I really am a doctor.

43:20.040 --> 43:21.400
Go, Dr. Cui.

43:22.520 --> 43:24.640
Don't worry. I will see myself out.

43:25.120 --> 43:26.600
I'm not seeing you out.

43:26.680 --> 43:28.600
Go with me for supper together.

43:28.680 --> 43:30.040
I'm hungry from the scolding.

43:30.680 --> 43:32.320
Sure. What are we eating? It's my treat.

43:38.000 --> 43:39.360
